'''''Neoorthocaulis''''' is a genus of [[liverwort]]s belonging to the family [[Anastrophyllaceae]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=''Neoorthocaulis'' L.Söderstr. |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/4905486 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=28 June 2023 |language=en}}</ref>

The species of this genus are mainly found in [[Northern Hemisphere]].<ref name="GBIF" />

